The runtime uses Python's standard library, including its sqlite3 interface.
Python and SQLite remain subject to their respective upstream terms.

No third-party agent framework, model weights, messaging SDK, OCR engine,
or document parser is bundled in this repository. Example and test data are
synthetic. Unicode fixtures exercise multilingual retrieval and do not
represent real people or messages.

The release package contains no user databases or managed document originals.
